#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40236"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40772"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41792"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42084"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42552"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43464"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47692"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47736"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552924"
msgid "―――However."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553008"
msgid "I'm satisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553024"
msgid "―――Barely made it somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553300"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553328"
msgid "…why is just #SVT[she][he][she][he]# standing there, staring at me…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553488"
msgid "It's as if―――we're… parting… ways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553544"
msgid "Not \"as if.\"\nThis is where we part, Praetor.\nI mustn't cross over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553812"
msgid "This stage truly left me satisfied.\n…my fight ends here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553872"
msgid "Not \"as if.\"\nThis is where we go our separate ways.\n…I mustn't cross over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554240"
msgid "No, it's not \"as if.\"\nThis is where we bid our farewells, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555456"
msgid "To be in misery would only serve to cloud\nyour smile anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555680"
msgid "Servants are designed to vanish in the end.\nMost are felled in battle.\nNot the case for me, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556924"
msgid "You hear me, Master #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nYou're a wonderful person.\nIt was worth fighting for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557236"
msgid "March on. No fear.\nYoung guys are always drawn to adventure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557464"
msgid "Ahh, now I can no longer sight my Darling's\ndashing… erm, visage―――*sob, sob, sob*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557780"
msgid "Am I not helping to make this scene look tragic?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581444"
msgid "I call out behind me:\n\"You there, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581504"
msgid "I call out behind me:\n\"Are you there, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581568"
msgid "………yes.\nWell done, Senpai.\nThat there is the exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581632"
msgid "Please, go through.\nYou deserve it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581888"
msgid "I got to meet her again.\nWith that, I know what I need to do now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581956"
msgid "…………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582140"
msgid "…we can't.\nI mustn't go there.\nLook―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583164"
msgid "―――I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583260"
msgid "In which case, I suppose it's completely pointless to\ntake #C236196003Sakura#CDEF with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583424"
msgid "That's true.\nSo please, go on ahead alone, Senpai.\nI'll see you off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583664"
msgid "Senpai―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583876"
msgid "Wh-wh-why!?\nWhat you're saying makes no sense!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583988"
msgid "That's only half the story.\nMy goal now is to leave with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584076"
msgid "She's become that dear to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584456"
msgid "……also."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584632"
msgid "―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585248"
msgid "―――I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585352"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF once said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585912"
msgid "Fake…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585924"
msgid "No. That's wrong.\nI may not know of a way to save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, either,\nbut I can tell her straight up what she's wrong about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586084"
msgid "I'm… wrong?\nSenpai, do you know what love is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586148"
msgid "…what is love, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586552"
msgid "#T2\n\n\n\nI may not know the answer,\nbut I know where you're wrong.\n　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　\n\n\n\n\n#T7"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586708"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587312"
msgid "In the end of times, when all warmth has cooled―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587440"
msgid "―――Sen, pai.\nSenpai, Senpai, Senpai……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587576"
msgid "I'm sorry for never saying that I loved you,\nthat I wanted to be with you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587776"
msgid "…I was right in my struggle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587808"
msgid "I wasn't able to compete for the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF as a Master,\nbut I got to leave something behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588364"
msgid "?\nOf course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588380"
msgid "The same way #C236196003Sakura#CDEF wants to be with me, I want to be with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588460"
msgid "…erm.\nIn that case, I have one last question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589128"
msgid "I see #[an adorable][a warm]# smile, beaming with hope―――"
msgstr ""

